  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Inclusiveness and Gender Equality in Mainland China - Empowering CSOs for Better Programming, Advocacy and Sustainable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective of the action: Enhancing the capacity of civil society organizations (hereafter as CSOs) in the economic downturn to support the employability of marginalized women (hereafter as MWs), thereby achieving their economic empowerment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objectives&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1: Strengthen the institutional development and resource mobilization capacities of CSOs focused on MWs, enhancing their survival and sustainable development in the Mainland China.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2: Improve the service capabilities of CSOs to better support their beneficiaries with diverse needs, for better employment opportunities and achieve economic empowerment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3: Enhance the advocacy capacities of CSOs focused on MWs to promote employment-related policies and regulations, as well as engage employers to provide more equitable employment and supportive workplace for MWs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4: Consolidate, analyze and promote the project&#xbf;s experience and best practices, facilitate replication of effective service models, and ultimately contribute to a more friendly environment for MWs employment among public and private sectors.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
